{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5b5aa5c619be0a18","name":"BL-39 Interrogator Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-5b5aa5c619be0a18","title":"BL-39 Interrogator Droid","revision":16096,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:13Z","sha256":"5083074d01ad72b949c0af4611ae858465aeeee6f4f9eb5cc3e16d2c32fe8bcd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16096","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=BL-39%20Interrogator%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5b5aa5c619be0a18","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A direct successor to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["IT-0 Interrogator Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IT-0_Interrogator_Droid","referenceId":"reference:adef89e591c21b09"},", the Aratech BL-39 Interrogator Droid is the result of a private company purchasing the schematics for the Imperial interrogation Droid and adapting them to a civilian model. Following the decline of the Empire after the Galactic Civil War, Aratech paid large sums for access to a number of top secret Imperial technological designs, including weapons, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},". The BL-39 is the result of this deal, and the Droid's design came about due to high demand from law enforcement agencies and local governments.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The BL-39 Interrogator Droid uses many components from modern Medical Droids, and part of the reason the Droid is so effective is that it can extract information from the target with minimal pain or physical injury. Its method of painless, medical information extraction actual results in the Droid being classified as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/1st-Degree_Droid"},", where its predecessor (a highly specialized Torture Droid) was a ",{"tag":"a","children":["2nd-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/2nd-Degree_Droid"},". Likewise, the BL-39 can be converted into a Medical Assistant Droid with little reprogramming, taking advantage of the Droid's existing medical knowledge.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Moff ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nyna Calixte"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nyna_Calixte","referenceId":"reference:1aa3c5b4469bd375"}," often employs BL-39 Interrogator Droids in her duties as the Director of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["BL-39 Interrogator Droids can be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["BL-39 Interrogator Droid Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/1st-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 1/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.mi